{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## How To Read This\n\nRed = the question. Cyan = a live branch.\nPurple = a branch we dropped, kept on\npurpose because dead ends are scored.\n\nDrag anything. Delete nothing.",
      "x": -560,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "root",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Which problem are we solving?\n\nPick one. We cannot submit both.",
      "x": -140,
      "y": -20,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "ps1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stress & Workload Manager\n\nShow a student everything they carry,\nthen help them carry less",
      "x": 320,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ps2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Travel Planner\n\nPlan a trip end to end, and re-plan it\nwhen something goes wrong",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Who exactly?\nNot \"students\"",
      "x": 740,
      "y": -320,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 70
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Why would they\nopen it twice?",
      "x": 740,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 70
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "What do they\nuse today?",
      "x": 740,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 70
    },
    {
      "id": "q4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Solo or group?\nThey are different products",
      "x": 740,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 70
    },
    {
      "id": "q5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "What breaks\nmid-trip?",
      "x": 740,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 70
    },
    {
      "id": "q6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Who already\ndoes this well?",
      "x": 740,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 70
    },
    {
      "id": "dropped",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Dropped branches live here\n\nMove a branch here instead of deleting it,\nand say what killed it. This is worth marks\ntwice: the ideation picture, and the\niteration record.",
      "x": -140,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6"
    },
